{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-localized-knot","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:localized-knot","kind":"definition","title":"Localized knot (knot at a point)","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-point","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-projective-line-object"],"tags":["knot","point","fibre","categorical"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.LocalizedKnot","text":"localized-knot.md","leanSource":"localized-knot.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:localized-knot\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)</code> be a quantum observable universe carrying the <a href=\"#def:projective-line-object\" data-at=\"quantum-observable-universes/differential-structures-reeb\">projective line object</a> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{P}(V) = G/T</code>. A <strong>localized knot</strong> is a pair</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  (p, K) \\in \\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathbf{C}}(\\mathbf{1}, A^{\\mathrm{co}T}) \\times \\mathrm{Knot}</code></pre>\n<p>where:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">p \\colon \\mathbf{1} \\to A^{\\mathrm{co}T}</code> is a <a href=\"#def:categorical-point\" data-at=\"quantum-observable-universes/particles\">categorical point</a> of the projective line;</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">K</code> is a knot type, an equivalence class of smooth embeddings <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">S^1 \\hookrightarrow S^3</code> under ambient isotopy.</li>\n</ol>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/localized-knot.md","heading":"Definition","number":"6.11.1","page":"b/def-localized-knot","qa":{"counts":{"pass":81,"fail":1,"warn":1,"na":9,"unknown":0,"stale":66},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.LocalizedKnot","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/localized-knot.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
